\f5\i Alive
\f4\i0  was the only word she could come up with. 
\f5\i Alive. That\'92s it. 
\f4\i0 It was very strange, she absently thought, that the Moral Compliance Directorate never picked upon this element of her psyche. Risk seeking was fun and she wanted more.\
