\f5\i I hope Cracker remembers the code, there can no trace.
\f4\i0  After about 10 minutes, the water shut off and a blast of warm air shot at her from above, within a minute she was completely dry, but with outrageously unkempt hair that would later take a tub of gel to tame. She considered the pile of malodorous clothes and with some artful ripping and tearing, she managed to remove most of the blackened material and then dressed, garments inside out.\
